{"4553130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Love All My Girls", "steam_appid": 4553130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/51606633ff47fba0c71795c6b0d23207.avif?t=1788169849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras_big/51606633ff47fba0c71795c6b0d23207.avif?t=1788169849 width=1560 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite lives, time rewind, and six girls to love. Die, reset, and make everyone happy in this romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love all my girls</strong> is a full-motion video (FMV) interactive dating game. Play as the charming protagonist and date six distinct girls in first person. Your choices lead to dozens of unique endings and write your one-of-a-kind romantic story! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do with infinite resurrection and time travel? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the future, save the world, win the lottery overnight… or date six girls at once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve lived every man’s dream but stepped into a fatal trap! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong choice and you meet a violent end—luckily, your power lets you turn back time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is just routine for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every reset, fate quietly shifts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cost of changing time may be heavier than you imagine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you redeem yourself in a bloody love triangle, or keep balancing six dangerous relationships with your power? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world’s future is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a playboy… and you are not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of endings, yet only one true ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a harem, and it’s pure love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xiao Yanyan</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood sweetheart, a cold yet prideful top‑school beauty who has cried countless tears for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/c7b63f3c3736e094792a165dc9857037.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/c7b63f3c3736e094792a165dc9857037.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/c7b63f3c3736e094792a165dc9857037.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liang Modi</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealthy Japanese heiress with a soul more noble than her status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/59512e351c70e825bb5e9618648ef2c4.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/59512e351c70e825bb5e9618648ef2c4.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/59512e351c70e825bb5e9618648ef2c4.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Chuchu</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your promised bride from the mountains, the gentlest and kindest girl you’ll ever meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/38b73cef25d2c464de97be568ad37f1f.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/38b73cef25d2c464de97be568ad37f1f.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/38b73cef25d2c464de97be568ad37f1f.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Han Qingyu</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elder twin sister, a surgeon—usually a gentle and caring partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/da398178a2597f8cc6ca606de2d4073c.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/da398178a2597f8cc6ca606de2d4073c.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/da398178a2597f8cc6ca606de2d4073c.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Han Bingyu</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The younger twin sister, an esports streamer, cosplayer, and voice actress—your playful, charming muse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/230286eb5be2856265409da858fd4391.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/230286eb5be2856265409da858fd4391.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/230286eb5be2856265409da858fd4391.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lan Luoxi</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top A-list celebrity, a strong queen to fans, but a devoted lover to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/545b29ba98102b5bd2e90be42f58aad5.poster.avif?t=1788169849\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/545b29ba98102b5bd2e90be42f58aad5.webm?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553130/extras/545b29ba98102b5bd2e90be42f58aad5.mp4?t=1788169849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First‑person FMV experience</strong>: Immerse yourself in a realistic 4K romantic adventure with superpowers, living a unique life in a modern Chinese city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time reversal &amp; multiple endings</strong>: Explore thousands of choices and dozens of endings through death and resets. Rewind to key moments—no jumping forward or to parallel timelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The most innocent playboy story</strong>: Use “death reset” to rewrite history and strive for a happy ending where all six girls find joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun interactive gameplay</strong>: Enjoy QTEs, voice control, rhythm games, and more, blending cinema and gami